OL,5,G1500 Choral Evensong
OL,6,     FFrom York Minster with members of
OL,7,     Fthe Rodolfus Choral Course, with
OL,8,     Fmusic by Richard Allain, Joseph
OL,9,     FTwist, Bairstow and Elgar.
OL,10,G1600 Composer of the Week: Greatest
OL,11,G     Showstoppers
OL,12,     F3/4. Donald Macleod follows Polish
OL,13,     Fpianist Maria Szymanowska as she
OL,14,     Fstrikes out on her own.
OL,15,G1700 In Tune
OL,16,     FPetroc introduces live music from
OL,17,     FLe Vent du Nord and chats to music
OL,18,     Fhistorian Ashley Kahn about John
OL,19,     FColtrane's musical legacy on the
OL,20,     F100th anniversary of his birth.
