OL,5,G1900 Classical Mixtape
OL,6,     FTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,7,     Fsoundscape of classical favourites
OL,8,     Ffrom Canteloube to Tchaikovsky.
OL,9,G1930 Radio 3 in Concert
OL,10,     FJohn Storgards and the BBC
OL,11,     FPhilharmonic in music by Sibelius
OL,12,     Fand Wagner. They are joined by
OL,13,     FJames McVinnie for Gabriella
OL,14,     FSmith's organ concerto 'Breathing
OL,15,     FForests'.
OL,16,G2145 The Essay: Coltrane's Sound
OL,17,     FCarlos Santana remembers how he
OL,18,     Fwas inspired by the spiritual jazz
OL,19,     Fof John Coltrane. Presented by
OL,20,     FAshley Kahn.
