OL,5,G2200 Night Tracks
OL,6,     FSara Mohr-Pietsch presents an
OL,7,     Fadventurous, immersive soundtrack
OL,8,     Ffor late-night listening, from
OL,9,     Fclassical to contemporary and
OL,10,     Feverything in between.
OL,11,G2330 'Round Midnight
OL,12,     FTonight, on the 100th birthday of
OL,13,     FJohn Coltrane, Soweto welcomes his
OL,14,     Fthird guest of the week, Shabaka,
OL,15,     Fto share some of the music by
OL,16,     FColtrane that has inspired him.
OL,17,G0030 Through the Night
OL,18,     FSpanish piano duo Luis and Victor
OL,19,     Fdel Valle give a colourful recital
OL,20,     Ffor piano four hands featuring
OL,21,     Fmusic by Ligeti, Poulenc, Ravel,
OL,22,     FGershwin and Milhaud.
